network-manager
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
bluez
bluedevil
libspa-0.2-bluetooth
powerdevil
power-profiles-daemon
upower
kscreen
plasma-systemmonitor
ksystemstats
plasma-disks
print-manager
plasma-discover
udisks2

