knights
stockfish
ksudoku
kpat
kmahjongg
kmines
kreversi
kfourinline
bovo
picmi
kblocks
kbreakout
kdiamond
kbounce
knavalbattle

# --- audio: alsa-ucm-conf tells PipeWire how to drive modern laptop audio (Intel SOF speakers and
